    "message": "Skip the secret pattern for text that cannot contain a secret\n\nThe secret pattern can match only text containing \"@\", \"sk-\" or \"bearer\"\nin any case. On long text without spaces, such as each KPI sample's\nsource_ids_json (about 3 KB), its address alternative rescans the text\nfrom every word and took about 1.5 ms per text; checking for the three\nsubstrings first takes about 2 us. casefold() covers the case variants the\npattern's IGNORECASE accepts (long s, Kelvin sign).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
